abstract: >-
  A simulation study of whether a network-derived contrast-ultrasound
  observation can reduce confounding between vascular constriction and matrix
  viscoelasticity in a reduced shear-wave model.
keywords:
  - contrast-enhanced ultrasound
  - shear wave elastography
  - vascular networks
  - inverse problems
  - uncertainty quantification
